      "id": "pepiniere",
      "code": null,
      "titre": {
        "fr": "Pépinière",
        "en": "Garden Nursery"
      },
      "sous": {
        "fr": "Sculptures de jardin",
        "en": "Garden sculptures"
      },
      "technique": {
        "fr": "Inox, corten",
        "en": "Stainless steel, corten"
      },
      "annees": {
        "fr": "depuis 2005",
        "en": "since 2005"
      },
      "texte": {
        "fr": [
          "Des sculptures d’inox et de corten pour jardins et espaces publics, la plupart baptisées de noms latins de plantes : Rosa ‘Lady Plus’, Nepenthes sanguinea, Heracleum mantegazzianum…",
          "Installées en collections privées à Bruxelles, à Art Nocturne Knokke (2013), square Steurs à Bruxelles (2014), dans les jardins Iweins à Rixensart (2015) et à Kreuzberg, Berlin (Veriditas, 2017)."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Stainless steel and corten sculptures for gardens and public spaces, most of them named after plants in Latin: Rosa ‘Lady Plus’, Nepenthes sanguinea, Heracleum mantegazzianum…",
          "Installed in private collections in Brussels, at Art Nocturne Knokke (2013), square Steurs in Brussels (2014), in the Iweins gardens in Rixensart (2015) and in Kreuzberg, Berlin (Veriditas, 2017)."
        ]
      },
